# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what the agent needs
# at runtime. Anything new added to the repo stays OUT of the image unless
# it's listed here - dev tools, tests, personal data and secrets can't leak
# in by accident.
*

!requirements.txt
!*.py
!web/

# Dev/one-off scripts (match !*.py above, so excluded again explicitly)
start.py
audit_tool_tokens.py
migrate_task_tags.py
